Query financial market data and generate structured analysis.

Use this tool when:
- The user asks about stock market, crypto, or financial markets
- The query involves price, trend, or investment conditions
- The user asks about "today market", "market situation", "price movement"

You MUST use this tool instead of general search when the question is about financial markets.

This tool provides structured insights including:
- Trend analysis
- Volatility
- Risk level
- Market sentiment

Valid symbol examples:
- Stocks: AAPL, MSFT, GOOGL, TSLA
- Crypto: BTC-USD, ETH-USD
- Indices: ^GSPC (S&P 500), ^DJI (Dow Jones)

IMPORTANT: Always provide a valid market symbol in the 'symbol' parameter.
If user doesn't specify a symbol, use a default like 'AAPL' or ask the user.

Do NOT rely on search tools for market data if this tool is available.
 name:query_market parameters:map[properties:map[symbol:map[description:Market symbol (e.g., AAPL, BTC-USD, ^GSPC) type:string]] required:[symbol] type:object] results:map[description:Structured market data analysis including price, trend, volatility, and insights properties:map[analysis:map[description:Market analysis and indicators properties:map[liquidity:map[description:Market liquidity (low, normal, high) example:normal type:string] market_sentiment:map[description:Overall market sentiment (bullish, bearish, neutral) example:bullish type:string] risk_level:map[description:Risk level (low, medium, high) example:low type:string]] type:object] insights:map[description:Key market insights and observations example:[Market is in uptrend phase Volatility is low] items:map[type:string] type:array] summary:map[description:Summary of market data properties:map[change:map[description:Price change from previous close example:%!s(float64=0.5) type:number] change_percent:map[description:Percentage change from previous close example:0.33% type:string] current_price:map[description:Current market price example:%!s(float64=150.25) type:number] open:map[description:Opening price for the current period example:%!s(float64=148.5) type:number] previous_close:map[description:Previous closing price example:%!s(float64=149.75) type:number] trend:map[description:Market trend (uptrend, downtrend, sideways) example:uptrend type:string] volatility:map[description:Volatility level (low, medium, high) example:low type:string] volume:map[description:Trading volume example:%!s(int=1000000) type:integer] volume_trend:map[description:Volume trend (stable, increasing, decreasing) example:stable type:string]] type:object] symbol:map[description:Market symbol (e.g., AAPL, BTC-USD) example:AAPL type:string] timestamp:map[description:Timestamp of the data in RFC3339 format example:2024-01-15T10:30:00Z type:string]] type:object]] map[description:Calculates time by adding or subtracting duration from 