ation. This tool provides comprehensive weather data including temperature, humidity, wind speed, precipitation probability, and weather conditions. Use this tool when user asks about weather, temperature, or forecast for any location. Requires latitude and longitude coordinates of the location. name:query_weather parameters:map[properties:map[days:map[description:Number of days to forecast (default: 7, max: 16) type:integer] latitude:map[description:The latitude coordinate of the location (e.g., 39.9042 for Beijing) type:string] longitude:map[description:The longitude coordinate of the location (e.g., 116.4074 for Beijing) type:string]] required:[latitude longitude] type:object] results:map[description:Weather forecast data with daily breakdown and insights properties:map[daily_forecast:map[description:Array of daily weather forecasts items:map[properties:map[date:map[description:Date in YYYY-MM-DD format example:2024-01-15 type:string] insights:map[description:Daily weather insights and recommendations example:[Temperature rising High chance of rain - consider carrying an umbrella] items:map[type:string] type:array] summary:map[properties:map[condition:map[description:Primary weather condition example:Partly cloudy type:string] max_precip_prob:map[description:Maximum precipitation probability (0-100) example:%!s(int=30) type:integer] max_wind_speed:map[description:Maximum wind speed in km/h example:%!s(float64=15.5) type:number] temperature_range:map[description:Temperature range in Celsius example:15.5°C ~ 22.3°C type:string] trend:map[description:Temperature trend (warming/cooling/stable) example:warming type:string]] type:object]] type:object] type:array] forecast_days:map[description:Number of days in the forecast (1-16) example:%!s(int=3) type:integer] overall_insights:map[description:Overall weather trends and patterns for the forecast period example:[Overall temperature trend: Warming up over the forecast period Rain expected on 2 day(s) during the forecast period] items:map[type:string] type:array]] type:object]] map[description:Calculates time by adding or subtracting duration from current time. Args format: 'operation:duration' where operation is 'add' or 'subtract', and duration is like '1h30m' (hours and minutes) name:calculate_time parameters:map[properties:map[duration:map[description:The duration to add or subtract, e.g., '1h30m' for 1 hour and 30 minutes type:string] operation:map[description:The operation to perform: 'add' or 'subtract' type:string]] required:[operation duration] type:object] results:map[description:Calculated time result properties:map[calculated_time:map[description:The calculated time in RFC3339 format example:2024-01-15T10:30:00+08:00 type:string]] type:object]] map[description:Tool for executing local bash (Linux/Mac) or cmd (Windows) commands. Use this tool when user needs to run system commands, check system status, or perform local operations. Returns command output, error messages, and exit code. 当用户需要执行系统命令、根据软件运行的系统类型，选择对应的系统命令。使用这个工具时，务必确保输入的命令是安全的，并且不会对系统造成破坏。系统的类型是:windows name:execute_command parameters:map[properties:map[command:map[description:The command to execute type:string]] required:[command] type:object] results:map[description:Execution results of the command including output, error messages, and exit code properties:map[command:map[description:The command that was executed example:ls -la type:string] error:map[description:Error message if the command failed (only present if there was an error) example:exit status 127 type:string] exit_code:map[description:Exit code of the command (only present if the command failed) example:%!s(int=127) type:integer] output:map[description:Standard output and error from the command example:total 24
