Parameters: premise (required), outline (optional), chapter_count (chapters to write this run, 1–30, default 6), output_dir (default novels/story_<unix>), resume (continue existing folder), author_notes (new ideas this session), refresh_outline (regenerate outline when resuming), style, language. name:novel_longform parameters:map[properties:map[author_notes:map[description:Optional: new ideas, tone shifts, or reminders for this session; appended to author_log.md with timestamp. type:string] chapter_count:map[description:Chapters to write in this invocation (1–30). Default 6. On resume, adds this many chapters after the last existing file. type:integer] language:map[description:Optional language name (e.g. 简体中文). If omitted, follow the premise language. type:string] outline:map[description:Optional outline. If empty on a new project, the tool generates one. On resume, existing outline.md is kept unless refresh_outline is true. type:string] output_dir:map[description:Directory under workspace/ (relative, no ..). Default: novels/story_<timestamp>. Reuse for continuation. type:string] premise:map[description:Story direction: first run = core idea; resume = today's continuation goals plus any new beats (keep concise). type:string] refresh_outline:map[description:If true with resume, regenerates outline from premise (overwrites outline.md). Use sparingly. type:boolean] resume:map[description:If true, continue from the last chapter_*.md in output_dir; load bible and metas. Same folder as a writer's project. type:boolean] style:map[description:Optional narrative style (e.g. literary, light novel, suspense). type:string]] required:[premise] type:object] results:map[description:JSON string: output_dir, files written, chapters_written, chapter_range, resume_used. type:object]] map[description:Tool for getting the current real-time date and time from the server. MUST use this tool when user asks about current time, today's date, or any time-related questions requiring real-time information. Returns date, time, weekday, lunar date, and holiday information.只要对话里涉及时间的要应该先调用这个接口获取当前时间，再根据用户需求进行回复 name:get_current_time parameters:map[properties:map[] required:[] type:object] results:map[description:Current time information including date, weekday, lunar date, and holiday properties:map[current_time:map[description:Current date and time in format 'YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS' example:2024-01-15 10:30:45 type:string] holiday:map[description:Holiday information (only present if it's a holiday) example:春节 type:string] lunar_date:map[description:Chinese lunar calendar date example:腊月初五 type:string] weekday:map[description:Day of the week in Chinese example:星期一 type:string]] type:object]] map[description:Converts a location name (city, address, landmark) into latitude and longitude coordinates. Input should be a place name like 'Beijing', 'New York', or 'Eiffel Tower'. Returns the coordinates and additional location details. name:geocoding parameters:map[properties:map[location:map[description:The location name to geocode. Must use 'location' as the parameter name. Examples: 'Beijing', 'Times Square', 'Tokyo Tower' type:string]] required:[location] type:object] results:map[description:Geocoding tool to convert a location name into latitude and longitude coordinates properties:map[latitude:map[description:The latitude coordinate of the location example:39.9042 type:string] longitude:map[description:The longitude coordinate of the location example:116.4074 type:string]] type:object]] map[description:传入date获取date对应日期和时间的详细信息，只要问今天适合干什么，问今天的运势，只要关于运气，玄学等等关于气运的都要调用这个接口。
	支持星座、儒略日、干支、生肖、节气、节日、彭祖百忌、吉神(喜神/福神/财神/阳贵神/阴贵神)方位、胎神方位、冲煞、纳音、星宿、八字、五行、十神、建除十二值星、青龙名堂等十二神、黄道日及吉凶、法定节假日及调休等,about almanac name:get_date_info_about_almanac parameters:map[properties:map[date:map[description:必要参数，指定查询的日期，格式为'YYYY-MM-DD'，如'2023-01-01'，或者不指定，则默认为当前时间 type:string]] required:[date] type:object] results:map[description:Comprehensive date information including solar and lunar calendar details, zodiac, festivals, and traditional almanac data properties:map[almanac:map[description:Traditional Chinese almanac information example:甲辰年 丁丑月 戊子日 (冲马 煞南) type:string] current_time:map[description:Current date and time in format 'YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS' example:2024-01-15 10:30:45 type:string] day_gan_zhi:map[description:Gan-Zhi (Stem-Branch) representation of the day example:戊子 type:string] holiday:map[description:Holiday information (only present if it's a holiday) example:春节 type:string] lunar_date:map[description:Lunar calendar date in Chinese format example:甲辰年腊月初五 type:string] month_gan_zhi:map[description:Gan-Zhi (Stem-Branch) representation of the month example:丁丑 type:string] solar_term:map[description:Solar term information (if applicable) example:小寒 type:string] weekday:map[description:Day of the week in Chinese example:星期一 type:string] year_gan_zhi:map[description:Gan-Zhi (Stem-Branch) representation of the year example:甲辰 type:string] zodiac:map[description:Chinese zodiac animal for the year example:龙 type:string]] type:object]]]
