ult properties:map[calculated_time:map[description:The calculated time in RFC3339 format example:2024-01-15T10:30:00+08:00 type:string]] type:object]] map[description:Manage files and folders inside the app's document library root (a folder named "workspace" under the app working directory). All paths are relative to that root — use forward slashes (e.g. "小说/三侠五义/第一回.md"). Safe: cannot escape outside the library.

