n:The duration to add or subtract, e.g., '1h30m' for 1 hour and 30 minutes type:string] operation:map[description:The operation to perform: 'add' or 'subtract' type:string]] required:[operation duration] type:object] results:map[description:Calculated time result properties:map[calculated_time:map[description:The calculated time in RFC3339 format example:2024-01-15T10:30:00+08:00 type:string]] type:object]] map[description:Write or update the user's in-app memo / diary file (Markdown). Same storage as the 备忘录 panel (data/memo.md).
